{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台『じょしらく弐〜時かけそば〜』 の上演が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表されました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年と同じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗落亭 苦来 役をやらせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/04/8082334/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くくるちゃんは去年やっていく中で\nすごく好きになったので\nまたくくるちゃんをやらせていただけて\n本当に嬉しいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空琉美遊亭 丸京役は 生駒ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蕪羅亭 魔梨威役は 愛未"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"防波亭 手寅役は さゆりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"波浪浮亭 木胡桃役は あーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/04/8082334/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームら の時間は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月12日(木) 19時\n5月14日(土) 13時\n5月17日(火) 19時\n5月19日(木) 14時\n5月21日(土) 17時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/04/8082334/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップバッターだよ！わあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回よりも成長できるように\n頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/04/8082334/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/04/8082334/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶寮 都路里"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/04/8082334/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古都パフェ\n春バージョン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丸東京店限定です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクのアイスは\nさくらアイスだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくらスイーツ好き～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白玉とか抹茶カステラとか苺とか\nたっぷりなのに\nサラッと食べれちゃうのは嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/04/8082334/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}